dot/pull/109816.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-13T17:37:06Z"},"body":"_Original Description:_\r\n\r\nExposed `Make_Unique_Recursive` for Resources that have Arrays/Dictionaries filled with Subresources. The reason for the adition is that it is tedious to manually set each and every subresource inside an Array or Dictionary when duplicating, but also because it aligns better with user expectations, since despite them not being direcly accessible like a property, they're still subresources.  Implementation wasnt that hard, what was difficult was to understand how to use metadatas (it'd be easier if I hadnt forgotten pass by reference was a thing but I digress)\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/430acce4-a897-4d4e-b963-bfc115fe419e\r\n\r\n#### To dos\r\n- [x] Add support for dictionaries ~~they are people too!~~\r\n- [x] Refactor code before sending it for review\n- [x] Show a class name when showing Resources on  the pop up.\r\n\r\n_Edit:_\r\nSorry everyone, Had some issues with Git and not being able to rebase, so the original PR (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109760) got closed when reseting the Head. Anyhow, here's the PR, ready for review.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/